
# Test out various syntax options for COBOL loops

Tron

# Perform Times
Perform 1 Time:
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform

Perform 2 Times:
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform

Perform 3 Times
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform

Perform 3 Times
    Display "Hello"
End

# Perform Until
Move Zero To x
Perform Until x > 0:
    Display "Hello"
    Add 1 To x
End-Perform

Move Zero To x
Perform Until x > 0
    Display "Hello"
    Add 1 To x
End-Perform

Move Zero To x
Perform Until x > 0
    Display "Hello"
    Add 1 To x
End

# Perform Varying
Perform Varying x From Zero By 1 Until x > 0:
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform

Perform Varying x From Zero By 1 Until x > 0
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform

Perform Varying x From Zero By 1 Until x > 0
    Display "Hello"
End

Perform With Test Before Varying x From Zero By 1 Until x > 0
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform

Perform Test Before Varying x From Zero By 1 Until x > 0
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform

Perform With Test After Varying x From Zero By 1 Until x > 0
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform

Perform Test After Varying x From Zero By 1 Until x > 0
    Display "Hello"
End-Perform
